  "canon:pmid": "9105126",
  "canon:title": "Postinfarction ventricular septal defect associated with long-term steroid therapy.",
  "canon:abstract": "Two cases of postinfarction ventricular septal rupture in patients on long-term steroid therapy are presented and the favourable outcome in both cases described. A possible association between steroid therapy and subsequent postinfarction septal rupture is discussed.",
  "canon:text": "Postinfarction ventricular septal defect associated with long-term steroid therapy. Two cases of postinfarction ventricular septal rupture in patients on long-term steroid therapy are presented and the favourable outcome in both cases described. A possible association between steroid therapy and subsequent postinfarction septal rupture is discussed.",
